WEBVTT

00:04:57.761 --> 00:05:00.330
Erikson’s eight stages
of moral development,

00:05:00.363 --> 00:05:02.199
the five stages of grief.

00:05:02.232 --> 00:05:04.634
These are all linear constructs.

00:05:05.435 --> 00:05:07.571
This model peaks in the 1970s

00:05:07.604 --> 00:05:10.574
with the idea that everyone does
the same thing in their 20s,

00:05:10.574 --> 00:05:12.008
the same thing in their 30s,

00:05:12.042 --> 00:05:16.479
then has a midlife crisis
between 39 and 44 and a half.

00:05:16.513 --> 00:05:17.514
(Laughter)

00:05:17.948 --> 00:05:22.619
It is hard to overstate
how powerful this idea was.

00:05:23.353 --> 00:05:25.155
There's only one problem.

00:05:25.155 --> 00:05:26.489
It's not true.

00:05:27.557 --> 00:05:30.660
Today, we've updated
how we look at the world.